   {"q":"You can't see the cash sink until you measure velocity.","a":"Not until velocity is measured can the cash sink be identified."},
   {"q":"The answer is rarely just one of the three.","a":"Rarely does the answer lie in a single lever alone."},
   {"q":"We only found the spare capacity by comparing with peers.","a":"Only by benchmarking against peers did we uncover the latent capacity."},
