   {"q":"Not until velocity is measured we see the cash sink.","a":"Not until velocity is measured do we see the cash sink. (inversão obrigatória: 'do we')"},
   {"q":"Rarely the answer lies in a single lever.","a":"Rarely does the answer lie in a single lever. (advérbio negativo inicial força inversão)"},
   {"q":"Only when capital is released we can redeploy it.","a":"Only when capital is released can we redeploy it. (inverte modal e sujeito: 'can we')"},
   {"q":"At no point the desk left capacity idle.","a":"At no point did the desk leave capacity idle. (inversão com 'did')"},
